{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X对人物心理因果的交代不如Y充分，尤其S04想表白的动机、S05暴露心意后的失措、S13想重新藏起喜欢的原因，Y讲得更连贯；部分感受词也略显堆叠。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X把每段核心意思放在醒目关键词上，话与感受交替呈现，边听边扫时容易迅速抓住人物此刻的状态；分时出现的感受词还能跟随音乐变化，尤其在旋律起伏、声部交替、情绪收放等地方，提供了比Y更细致具体的聆听体验。Y的优势是心理动机和故事因果交代得更充分，前后叙事也更自然，但部分长句需要读完才能理解。综合边听边看的实际体验，我选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ed8dc560-e452-4a8b-a11c-645e05eb4153", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T062603882339Z", "elapsed_seconds": 93.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T06:27:37.193557+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b81b83948c4e2409af65382add65a134427d0ca5ea84e71f496942f8f331d602", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\